1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,302
Look at the curves.

2
00:00:01,302 --> 00:00:05,000
Velocity peaks a quarter period before displacement.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,822
It leads by pi by two.

4
00:00:06,822 --> 00:00:13,450
And acceleration is always the mirror image of displacement, exactly pi out of phase.

